---
name: plan
description: A unit written for the diagram tests.
type: workflow
icon: unit.plan
modification_date: 2026-01-15
version: 0.1.0
author: plan-marshall
---
# The composed unit of a plan instance version, written for the instance diagram tests and not
# taken from any default unit or instance of the product. Its header lives in DiagramFixtures:
# it prunes a step, a state and a policy action and waives the gate finalize.merge-gate, so
# every form shows pruned elements with their reason and a waived gate with its waiver id.
workflow plan version 3 format 1
scope plan
start outline.deep

state outline.deep
    auto diagram.proceed
        done -> finalize.merge-gate

state finalize.merge-gate
    auto diagram.ready
        held -> finalize.archive-plan
        not_held -> finalize.hand-back

state finalize.hand-back
    auto diagram.proceed
        done -> finalize.archive-plan

state finalize.archive-plan terminal completed success
